KernelSU (kernel-side driver) — vendored snapshot

  source   : https://github.com/backslashxx/KernelSU
  branch   : master
  commit   : 709711bd91f2c9098bd35dc9036291ba8863a276 ("KernelSU v3.3.1+")
  upstream commit date : 2026-08-17
  vendored on          : 2026-10-22

  layout   : only KernelSU/kernel/ is vendored (the kernel driver);
             manager/userspace are not needed to build the kernel.

  wiring (mirrors upstream kernel/setup.sh):
    drivers/kernelsu -> ../KernelSU/kernel        (symlink)
    drivers/Makefile : obj-$(CONFIG_KSU) += kernelsu/
    drivers/Kconfig  : source "drivers/kernelsu/Kconfig"

  hook mode for this 4.14 non-GKI tree:
    CONFIG_KSU=y
    CONFIG_KSU_TAMPER_SYSCALL_TABLE=y   (sys_call_table hijack for sucompat +
                                         sys_reboot; no kprobes, no manual
                                         fs/*.c hooks; upstream recommends
                                         this mode for 3.0 - 4.14)
